# Deploy topology

| Host | Service | Port |
|---|---|---|
| `vortex.timant32.ru` | this SPA | `127.0.0.1:18081` |
| `my.vortex.timant32.ru` | vortex-web console | `127.0.0.1:18080` |
| `api.vortex.timant32.ru` | vortex-core | API + WSS |
| `vortex.timant32.ru/agent/` | host static binaries | `/opt/vortex-web/agent-bins/` |

Until cutover, production console is still the apex. Do not point apex nginx at `:18081` yet.

VPS paths: `/opt/vortex-site`, `/opt/vortex-web`, `/opt/vortex-core`. SSH host alias: `timant32`.
